text bx_mown "\"owner\":"
text bx_csfx "-c"
note brain.om: the Company Brain (Omega extension; not in cortex-rs and not in the parity corpus).
note A Brain entry is an entity of the existing store, written as one ENTITY log record:
note canonicalName = entry id, entityType = "brain." + kind, validFrom = UTC date YYYY-MM-DD,
note content = body, metadata = {"owner":O} or {"owner":O,"supersedes":S}. Kinds: decision, rule,
note case, change (free text) and contract, party (structured records, see bn_vline).
note "Superseded" is derived on every request from the supersedes links of the stored entries
note (bsup: superseder slot + 1 per entity slot); the superseded entry is never rewritten.
note Routes (POST, JSON, the same token and space scopes as /api/cortex/*) and the export file
note format: spec/CORTEX-API.md "Company Brain". No size limit of its own: every scan runs to the
note end of its input with unguarded literal loop counts; sizes are bounded by the store (EMAX
note entity slots, hs/hc pools) and the request (2,097,152 bytes), both reported by brain/usage.
const B_KIND ulong 30
const B_OWN ulong 31
const B_DATE ulong 32
const B_BODY ulong 33
const B_SUP ulong 34
const B_DAYS ulong 35
const B_TAX ulong 36
const B_REG ulong 37
const B_NEWID ulong 38
const B_TEXT ulong 39
note bsup: superseder slot + 1 per entity slot (0 = not superseded). It is kept live: built once from
note the replayed log (bn_ensure, on the first request that needs it), then updated by every Brain
note write (bn_commit). A retract or hard delete marks it stale (bn_stale), and the next request
note rebuilds it. bvi 1 = valid for every space. bsc is the scratch copy of the consistency check.
global bsup ulong EMAX
global bsc ulong EMAX
global bvi uchar 1
global bwr uchar 1
global bmn ulong 2
global bdy long 1
global bdh uchar 1
global bdt uchar 16
global bvc ulong 16
global bal long 8
global bfa ulong 4
global bfd long 1
global bhd ulong 4
global bpb uchar 4096
global bpbl ulong 1
global bxo uchar 1
global bxd uchar 4096
global bxdl ulong 1
text pt_bwr "/api/cortex/brain/write"
text pt_brd "/api/cortex/brain/read"
text pt_bget "/api/cortex/brain/get"
text pt_bcf "/api/cortex/brain/confirm"
text pt_bal "/api/cortex/brain/alerts"
text pt_brec "/api/cortex/brain/records"
text pt_bimp "/api/cortex/brain/import"
text pt_buse "/api/cortex/brain/usage"
text bs_wr "id|space|kind|owner|date|body|supersedes"
text by_wr "ccaacac"
