text bx_line " (line "
text be_id "id must be non-empty, use only A-Z a-z 0-9 . _ - and not start with ."
text be_kind "kind must be one of decision, rule, case, change, contract, party"
text be_own "owner must be non-empty text without control characters"
text be_date "date must be a calendar date YYYY-MM-DD (proleptic Gregorian, UTC)"
text be_supid "supersedes must be a valid entry id"
text be_dup "an entry with this id already exists in this space (entries are append-only; write a new entry that supersedes it): "
text be_nsup "supersedes names no Brain entry in this space: "
text be_ssup "that entry is already superseded; supersede the newer entry instead: "
text be_nf "no Brain entry with this id in this space: "
text be_nctr "confirm needs a live (not superseded, not retracted) contract record: "
text be_conf "this contract record is already confirmed: "
text be_cyes "a contract record is written unconfirmed: confirm it with /api/cortex/brain/confirm or by importing a hand-corrected file"
text be_rec "contract record lines are `key: value` with key doc_type, registry_id, subject, party, date, confirmed or note; doc_type is contract, amendment, extension, tender, call or framework_agreement; date is `KIND YYYY-MM-DD` with KIND hard_expiry, on_completion, submission_deadline, extension or start (on_completion may give - for no date); party is a tax ID without spaces; confirmed is yes or no"
text be_rcnt "a contract record needs exactly one doc_type line and at most one registry_id, subject and confirmed line"
text be_pty "party record lines are `key: value` with key name, tax_id or note; tax_id has no spaces"
text be_pcnt "a party record needs exactly one name line and at least one tax_id line"
text be_days "days is required: a whole number of days (alerts cover date .. date + days, both ends included)"
text be_long "the task gives an FTS query longer than the query buffer of the FTS replica (om/fts.om qq, 1048576 bytes)"
text be_fcap "the task needs more query terms than the FTS replica holds (om/fts.om capacities)"
text be_fts "the FTS query failed"
text be_hdr "an export file starts with header lines (id:, kind:, ...) and a blank line before the body"
text be_simp "this entry was already corrected by a different entry; correct that entry's file instead: "
text be_guard "{\"error\":\"Brain entries are append-only: write them through /api/cortex/brain/write\"}"
text be_big "the answer is larger than the server's 16 MiB output buffer (om/f64.om job); ask for fewer entries (limit) or a narrower window"
